      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolName": "Qdrant",
        "toolDescription": "This tool is a Vector Store Embeddings retriever for Bitovi’s blog content. It holds vectorized representations (embeddings) of all Bitovi blog articles and uses semantic similarity search to find the most relevant excerpts based on a natural language query. Unlike exact keyword matching, it understands the meaning behind the query and matches it against the content of the blog posts. The tool returns a set of blog excerpts along with associated metadata such as title, date, category, author, and summary. Use this tool when the query is broad or context-focused, or when the answer depends on the overall content and semantic relationships in the blog data, rather than on strict metadata filters.",
